graph LR
    VG["vllm-gaudi<br/>odh-vllm-gaudi-rhel9"]

    %% External Dependencies
    VG -->|inference engine + API server| VLLM["vLLM v0.16.0"]
    VG -->|HPU drivers, graph compiler| Synapse["Intel Gaudi SW / Synapse<br/>1.23.0-695"]
    VG -->|HPU backend| HabanaPT["Habana PyTorch modules<br/>PyTorch 2.9.0"]
    VG -->|media loading| MediaLoader["habana-media-loader<br/>1.23.0.695"]
    VG -->|distributed execution| Ray["ray >=2.48.0"]
    VG -->|models / tokenizers| Transformers["transformers >=4.56.0,&lt;5"]
    VG -->|numeric runtime| Numeric["numpy / pandas / numba"]
    VG -->|runtime| Python["Python 3.12"]
    VG -.->|optional KV transfer| NIXL["NIXL"]

    %% Internal Platform Dependencies
    KServe["KServe"] -->|deploys as ServingRuntime<br/>HTTP/8000| VG
    Templates["odh-model-controller /<br/>odh-dashboard templates"] -.->|expose runtime| KServe
    DevicePlugin["Intel Gaudi device plugin /<br/>Habana operator"] -->|habana.ai/gaudi| VG

    %% External Services
    VG -->|model weights HTTPS/443| Storage["Model storage<br/>S3 / HF Hub / PVC"]
    VG -.->|build: base image| UBI["UBI 9.6<br/>(not AIPCC, not pinned)"]
    VG -.->|build: source clone, PyPI,<br/>Habana vault, CentOS, EPEL| BuildSrc["Non-hermetic<br/>build sources"]

